RoomGuard emulates the behaviour of the DSC PC1550 and DSC PowerSeries
PC1832 alarm panels. It is not made by, endorsed by or affiliated with DSC
or any manufacturer named in it. Product names are used only to describe
what is being emulated. The keypads drawn by the app are original designs.

Third party material included in this repository:

Inter typeface (assets/fonts/Inter-Regular.otf, assets/fonts/Inter-SemiBold.otf)
  Copyright 2016 The Inter Project Authors (https://github.com/rsms/inter)
  Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
  See assets/fonts/LICENSE-Inter.txt.

Face detection cascade (assets/cascade/lbp_frontalface.bin)
  Converted by tools/convert_cascade.py from lbpcascade_frontalface.xml,
  part of the OpenCV project (https://github.com/opencv/opencv), as
  redistributed in scikit-image's data folder. OpenCV is distributed under
  the Apache License 2.0 (releases 4.5 and later) and the 3-clause BSD
  license (earlier releases).

Rust crates used at build time are listed in Cargo.toml and keep their own
licenses (MIT, Apache 2.0 or similar).
